---
title: Feed Polling Data Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant EB as EventBridge<br/>(every 5min)
    participant Orch as Orchestrator<br/>Lambda
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant SQS as SQS Feed Queue
    participant Worker as Worker Lambda
    participant Feed as RSS Feed Server
    participant SNS as SNS
    participant APNs as APNs
    participant Device as iOS Device
    participant SQLite as SQLite Store
    participant Pipeline as River Pipeline<br/>(stages 2-5)

    EB->>Orch: trigger
    Orch->>PG: SELECT feeds WHERE next_fetch_at <= NOW()
    PG-->>Orch: due feed URLs
    loop Each feed URL
        Orch->>SQS: enqueue feed_url
    end

    SQS->>Worker: dequeue
    Worker->>Feed: GET feed.xml<br/>(If-None-Match: etag)
    alt 304 Not Modified
        Feed-->>Worker: 304
        Worker->>PG: UPDATE last_fetched_at
    else 200 New Content
        Feed-->>Worker: 200 + XML
        Worker->>Worker: parse RSS/Atom
        Worker->>Worker: compute FNV-1a UUIDs
        Worker->>PG: diff against existing items
        Worker->>PG: INSERT new feed_items
        Worker->>PG: SELECT subscribers
        PG-->>Worker: subscriber device tokens
        Worker->>SNS: push to subscribers
        SNS->>APNs: silent push<br/>(content-available: 1)
    end

    APNs->>Device: wake app
    Device->>PG: GET /v1/river?since=lastSync
    PG-->>Device: FeedItem[] delta + read state
    Device->>SQLite: upsertCloudItems()
    SQLite->>Pipeline: runCycle()
    Note over Pipeline: Clustering, rate gating,<br/>decay scoring, snapshot<br/>all run on-device unchanged
